<title>USA: ChoicePoint ends planned Kroll acquisition.</title>
<headline>ChoicePoint ends planned Kroll acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>ChoicePoint Inc said Thursday it will not buy consulting firm Kroll Associates Inc of New York.</p>
<p>The provider of anti-fraud information systems said in a statement the parties were unable to reach a definitive merger agreement but will continue to cooperate and seek mutual opportunities.</p>
<p>ChoicePoint, formerly Equifax Insurance Services, said on April 1 it reached an agreement in principle to buy Kroll.</p>
